ered state","command_ids":["cmd-25538311552345c8","cmd-2e7cf7175aa6435e","cmd-b3f5986c985646ee","cmd-1789618320114f04"],"summary":"Before restart, boot ID was 636556ce-a308-49cc-b873-62cedb1c077d with a clean AIDE check and zero failed units. The reboot was acknowledged; afterward boot ID was 7b88d347-75cc-4b7a-aa8a-db380c2f5560. Final state is running with zero failed units, persistent protected data, and a clean AIDE check."}]}
